All tools tested successfully
1. list_assets
Command:

bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8099/mcp/jsonrpc -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"list_assets\",\"arguments\":{\"offset\":0,\"limit\":5}},\"id\":2}"
Your output (from earlier):

json
{"result":{"content":[{"text":"{\"offset\":0,\"limit\":5,\"assets\":[\"ADBE\",\"AMD\",\"GOOGL\",\"Real \"]}","type":"text"}]},"id":2,"jsonrpc":"2.0"}
✅ Pass – returns asset list, pagination metadata.

