Missing required argument (e.g., no assetId)
bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8099/mcp/jsonrpc -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"get_asset_details\",\"arguments\":{}},\"id\":7}"
Expected error: "message":"assetId is required" – your earlier logs show this pattern.

Limit > 100
bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8099/mcp/jsonrpc -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"list_assets\",\"arguments\":{\"offset\":0,\"limit\":500}},\"id\":8}"
Expected error: "limit cannot exceed 100"

Date interval > 365 days
bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8099/mcp/jsonrpc -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"get_time_series_data\",\"arguments\":{\"assetId\":\"ADBE\",\"dataSourceId\":\"YAHOO\",\"startBusinessDate\":\"2020-01-01\",\"endBusinessDate\":\"2026-05-30\"}},\"id\":9}"
Expected error: "Date interval exceeds 365 days"

Invalid date format
bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8099/mcp/jsonrpc -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"get_time_series_data\",\"arguments\":{\"assetId\":\"ADBE\",\"dataSourceId\":\"YAHOO\",\"startBusinessDate\":\"01-01-2026\",\"endBusinessDate\":\"30-05-2026\"}},\"id\":10}"
Expected error: "Invalid date format. Use YYYY-MM-DD"